                        "glosses": [
                            "A bugbear; an imaginary monster to frighten children."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aef19bab-5061-4ce7-96e7-341209b76400",
                                "sense_id": "5b13bca0-496e-3aab-a5f2-a6eb1b1dba2f",
                                "text": "Is hell but a name and word, a scarebug for to keep fools in awe?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29b6997d-934d-4a01-b0b1-19ece0b6fe4c",
                                "sense_id": "5b13bca0-496e-3aab-a5f2-a6eb1b1dba2f",
                                "text": "You can't fright me with your scarebugs. I'm going to be cremated. That's real ashes to ashes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56968811-b11b-4d74-8ba7-208e1224eaee",
                                "sense_id": "5b13bca0-496e-3aab-a5f2-a6eb1b1dba2f",
                                "text": "The argument is a mere scarebug of the opposition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af608366-c472-409d-925b-86b7b633b01c",
                                "sense_id": "5b13bca0-496e-3aab-a5f2-a6eb1b1dba2f",
                                "text": "As for painting, we have the portraits of Viceroys exhibited in the Government Council Hall, monstrous scarebugs made in series which may serve to terrorise our councillors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
